=== 8. case with multiple patterns
  [a]        -> letter abc
  [b]        -> letter abc
  [c]        -> letter abc
  [1]        -> digit
  [X]        -> starts upper
  [HELLO]    -> starts upper
  [foo.txt]  -> txt file
  [bar.cpp]  -> has extension
  [baz]      -> other [baz]
  []         -> empty
  [9z]       -> other [9z]
